{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "updated": "2026-07-31",
  "notes": {
    "cursor": "Cursor On-Demand effective blended rates, NOT Anthropic/OpenAI direct prices. Cursor caches conversation context very aggressively (>85% hit rate typical), and its binary protobuf responses do not expose cache_read_input_tokens the way the Anthropic JSON API does. BidiAppend calls carrying conversation history are filtered as proxy noise, so byte-estimated tokens are heavily skewed toward output_tokens. These rates are calibrated against observed Cursor On-Demand invoices to land within ~2x of actual billing. If Cursor ever exposes cache-aware token counts in its gRPC responses, raise these toward the underlying Anthropic/OpenAI direct rates.",
    "retired": "Model has been retired from the OpenAI product and/or API. Entries are kept for cost attribution of historical traffic. o1-preview shutdown 2025-07-28; o1-mini shutdown 2025-10-27; entire o-series retired from ChatGPT 2026-02-13 (API access may still function for existing integrations).",
    "sonnet5-intro": "Standard rate tracked here. Anthropic runs an introductory rate of $2/$10 per MTok (input/output) through 2026-08-31; the $3/$15 standard rate takes effect 2026-09-01, so this entry is already correct as of then and needs no change. To reflect the promo before then, temporarily lower this entry to 2.00/10.00 (cache_read 0.20, cache_write 2.50).",
    "openai_5_6_cut": "2026-07-30: OpenAI cut gpt-5.6-luna and gpt-5.6-terra by up to 80%. Luna 1.00/6.00 -> 0.20/1.20, Terra 2.50/15.00 -> 2.00/12.00. Verified against the OpenAI pricing page on 2026-07-31."
  },
